detaileddescription.para:
Here's how to convert a vector of addresses to space-separated hexadecimal values: usingnamespaceRose::StringUtility;
std::vector<Address>addresses=...;
std::strings=join("",toStrings(addresses,addrToString));

Here's how one could surround each address with angle brackets: usingnamespaceRose::StringUtility;
structAngleSurround{
std::stringoperator()(Addressaddr){
return"<"+addrToString(addr)+">";
}
};
std::strings=join("",toStrings(addresses,AngleSurround()));
